{
  "id": "avengers-finale-2005-1",
  "synopsis": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "AVENGERS DISASSEMBLED EPILOGUE! In the wreckage of Avengers Mansion, Earth's Mightiest Heroes meet for the very last time! It's the end of an era, brought to you by Brian Bendis and an all-star cast of artists, including names like GEORGE PEREZ, STEVE EPTING, JIM CHEUNG, ERIC POWELL, DARICK ROBERTSON, MIKE OEMING, ALEX MALEEV, DAVID MACK and many more! Surely, there isn't a dry eye in the House of Ideas, True Believer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "SPOILERS"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Avengers reunite in the ruins of Avengers Mansion and reminisce on their best times as a team. It's forty years of memories spanning almost every formation of the roster."
    }
  ],
